{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tezzel</strong> is a cozy, colorful, and deeply challenging puzzle game where every move shapes a masterpiece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of Mateu, an aging tilemaker in 1910 Barcelona, as he restores his reputation by completing a grand tile wall for the great master Gaud\u00ed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/Separator.png?t=1748103130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/mateu_mirant.png?t=1748103130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/Separator.png?t=1748103130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tilemaking is an intricate art that requires precision, planning, and problem-solving. You\u2019ll need to experiment, analyse, and think ahead to complete each tile and master the craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/Gif1.gif?t=1748103130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress, you\u2019ll unlock new tilemaking tools that introduce unique mechanics. Discover 10 tools across 100+ handcrafted levels, each with their own puzzling twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/gif2.gif?t=1748103130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/gif3.gif?t=1748103130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/gif4.gif?t=1748103130\" /></div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/Separator.png?t=1748103130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each solved puzzle adds a new tile to Mateu\u2019s masterpiece. Watch the wall transform from an empty canvas to a vibrant work of art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/mateu_currant.png?t=1748103130\" /></div><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/Separator.png?t=1748103130\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master Mindbending Mechanics:</strong> Discover new tilemaking tools that start out simple and build up into confounding conundrums</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100+ Handcrafted Puzzles</strong>: Each level is thoughtfully designed to challenge and delight with no filler, just elegant and clever puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nonlinear Progression:</strong> if one puzzle stumps you, explore others and find your own way through the wall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tribute to Tile Artistry</strong>: Enjoy colorful pixel art and a serene soundtrack that transport you to early 20th-century Barcelona</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/Separator.png?t=1748103130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0 Can you help Mateu finish his masterpiece, one tile at a time?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/Mateu_Full_completed.png?t=1748103130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/Separator.png?t=1748103130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703730?t=1748103130","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/95f018ffe85178c5ae30e9e7893e83790bfaee9f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748103130","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/81fdcef9e6bcb8ff187f0f249af9d32cc5a72d07/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748103130","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/81fdcef9e6bcb8ff187f0f249af9d32cc5a72d07/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748103130","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tezzel</strong> is a cozy, colorful, and deeply challenging puzzle game where every move shapes a masterpiece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of Mateu, an aging tilemaker in 1910 Barcelona, as he restores his reputation by completing a grand tile wall for the great master Gaud\u00ed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/Separator.png?t=1748103130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/mateu_mirant.png?t=1748103130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/Separator.png?t=1748103130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tilemaking is an intricate art that requires precision, planning, and problem-solving. You\u2019ll need to experiment, analyse, and think ahead to complete each tile and master the craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/Gif1.gif?t=1748103130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress, you\u2019ll unlock new tilemaking tools that introduce unique mechanics. Discover 10 tools across 100+ handcrafted levels, each with their own puzzling twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/gif2.gif?t=1748103130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/gif3.gif?t=1748103130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/gif4.gif?t=1748103130\" /></div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/Separator.png?t=1748103130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each solved puzzle adds a new tile to Mateu\u2019s masterpiece. Watch the wall transform from an empty canvas to a vibrant work of art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/mateu_currant.png?t=1748103130\" /></div><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/Separator.png?t=1748103130\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master Mindbending Mechanics:</strong> Discover new tilemaking tools that start out simple and build up into confounding conundrums</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100+ Handcrafted Puzzles</strong>: Each level is thoughtfully designed to challenge and delight with no filler, just elegant and clever puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nonlinear Progression:</strong> if one puzzle stumps you, explore others and find your own way through the wall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tribute to Tile Artistry</strong>: Enjoy colorful pixel art and a serene soundtrack that transport you to early 20th-century Barcelona</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/Separator.png?t=1748103130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0 Can you help Mateu finish his masterpiece, one tile at a time?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/Mateu_Full_completed.png?t=1748103130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/extras/Separator.png?t=1748103130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Old Mayor Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703730/82c88fd35f1d5abe0ec1fc91fc6ea4d103a45b63/header.jpg?t=1748103130","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{